[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0010","text":"咦……\n雨…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0020","text":"……好像下起来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0030","text":"哇，真的下起来了……！？\n还好把晾的衣服收进来了——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0040","text":"诶\n天气预报明明说──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0005","text":"是晴天的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0006","text":"是阴天的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_00_0007","text":"是下雨的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_01_0010","text":"诶——？\n那是哪里的天气预报啊？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_01_0020","text":"咦，是我看错了吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_02_0010","text":"是吗？\n那天气预报不准了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_02_0020","text":"我信了它，把毛巾晾出去了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_03_0010","text":"我没带伞"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07080000_03_0020","text":"那，我\n有备用的伞……！"}]
